            <h1>SeeShell is now Kantu <a href="/rpa/x/desktop-automation">Desktop Automation</a></h1>

            <p>
                March 1, 2019: With Ui.Vision we have merged the SeeShell and Kantu products into one. The new formular is: Kantu (old) + SeeShell = Ui.Vision (new).
            </p>
            <p>
                All SeeShell PRO and Enterprise users received a free cross-upgrade to the corresponding Ui.Vision Editions. If you did not receive the emails for any
